    "body": "The owner no longer uses OpenCode; DeepSeek runs in its own harness.\n- **Who reviews whom:** the DeepSeek lab peer-audits the Claude lab's PRs at each of its status cards, against `docs/labs/audit.md`, and posts `PEER AUDIT (DeepSeek → Claude)` on #2028.\n- **The scheduled Claude audit:** it covers DeepSeek and Codex, and lists unreviewed Claude PRs as `awaiting peer audit`. It never passes them itself.\n- **Prompts:** the DeepSeek and Claude prompts in `session-goal.md` are updated to match.\n\nReferences #2028\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
